//
// `tfp` ToString KNOWN ANSWERS (D-195) -- generated by the workbench
// python against `fractions` (exact rational arithmetic): the rendering
// of raw/2^F must be the EXACT finite decimal expansion, trailing zeros
// trimmed, mandatory fraction digit, ERR for the sentinel. Raw values
// are built FROM BITS through the store/load trick, so literal folding
// is out of the loop; seed 1302.
